hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1310","Abu Hurayra said"
"1311","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"1312","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1313","'Ammar ibn Yasir said"
"1314","'Urwa ibn az-Zubayr heard 'A'isha say"
"1315","'Imran ibn Husayn said"
"1316","Ibn 'Umar said"
"1317","Abu Bakra reported that the Prophet"
"1318","Muhammad ibn al-Hanafiyya said"
"1319","Abu Mas'ud said"
"1320","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"1321","Ibn 'Umar said"
